  "prefLabel": "Res 7801.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 7801.01 Applicability. The provisions of Res 7802 shall apply to all department of resources and economic development (DRED) properties listed in Res 101.06, and subsequent properties and easements upon acquisition, and to all listed conservation or trail easement properties held by DRED to the extent that these provisions apply to the rights granted to the state or the restrictions placed on the property.\n\nSource. #10534, eff 3-1-14",
